  <a href="./README.zh_CN.md"><img alt="README in Simplified Chinese" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/简体中文-d9d9d9"></a>
  <a href="./README.ja.md"><img alt="README in Japanese" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/日本語-d9d9d9"></a>
